---
import { withBase } from '../lib/site';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="wrap">
		<p>
			A catalog of open kidney research datasets. Coverage is partial and selective, not exhaustive, and every
			record links to the sources it came from. See <a href={withBase('/about/')}>About</a> for what verification
			covers, or <a href={withBase('/contribute/')}>Contribute</a> to suggest a correction.
		</p>
		<p>
			This site hosts no patient data. Access to each dataset stays with its provider, under that provider's own
			terms.
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
